## 🚀 One-Click Extraction with Bookmarklet

This wizard provides the **easiest possible** way to extract your Nest credentials.

### Option 1: Bookmarklet (Recommended - Desktop Only)

**One-time Setup (30 seconds):**

1. **Create the Bookmarklet:**
   - **Drag this link to your bookmarks bar**: <a href="javascript:(async function(){if(!window.location.hostname.includes('nest.com')){alert('❌ Please run this on home.nest.com');return;}try{const entries=performance.getEntriesByType('resource');const issueTokenEntry=entries.find(e=>e.name.includes('issueToken'));if(!issueTokenEntry){alert('❌ No token found. Refresh the page and try again.');return;}const issueToken=issueTokenEntry.name;const cookies=document.cookie;if(!issueToken.startsWith('https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/iframerpc')||!issueToken.includes('action=issueToken')){alert('❌ Invalid token URL');return;}if(!cookies||cookies.length<100){alert('❌ Cookies incomplete. Sign in first.');return;}const requiredCookies=['HSID=','SSID=','APISID=','SAPISID='];const missing=requiredCookies.filter(c=>!cookies.includes(c));if(missing.length>0){alert('⚠️ Missing cookies: '+missing.join(', ').replace(/=/g,'')+'. Make sure you are signed in.');}const text=issueToken+'\n\n'+cookies;try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);alert('✅ Credentials successfully extracted and copied to clipboard!\n\nGo back to Home Assistant and paste the values:\n1. Issue Token URL (first line)\n2. Cookies (rest)');}catch(e){alert('✅ Credentials successfully extracted!\n\nIssue Token URL:\n'+issueToken+'\n\nCookies:\n'+cookies);}}catch(error){console.error('Error:',error);alert('❌ Error: '+error.message);}})();">🔐 Nest Credentials Extractor</a>
   - Or manually add a bookmark with this name: `Nest Credentials`
   - And this URL: `javascript:(async function(){if(!window.location.hostname.includes('nest.com')){alert('❌ Please run this on home.nest.com');return;}try{const entries=performance.getEntriesByType('resource');const issueTokenEntry=entries.find(e=>e.name.includes('issueToken'));if(!issueTokenEntry){alert('❌ No token found. Refresh the page and try again.');return;}const issueToken=issueTokenEntry.name;const cookies=document.cookie;if(!issueToken.startsWith('https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/iframerpc')||!issueToken.includes('action=issueToken')){alert('❌ Invalid token URL');return;}if(!cookies||cookies.length<100){alert('❌ Cookies incomplete. Sign in first.');return;}const requiredCookies=['HSID=','SSID=','APISID=','SAPISID='];const missing=requiredCookies.filter(c=>!cookies.includes(c));if(missing.length>0){alert('⚠️ Missing cookies: '+missing.join(', ').replace(/=/g,'')+'. Make sure you are signed in.');}const text=issueToken+'\n\n'+cookies;try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);alert('✅ Credentials successfully extracted and copied to clipboard!\n\nGo back to Home Assistant and paste the values:\n1. Issue Token URL (first line)\n2. Cookies (rest)');}catch(e){alert('✅ Credentials successfully extracted!\n\nIssue Token URL:\n'+issueToken+'\n\nCookies:\n'+cookies);}}catch(error){console.error('Error:',error);alert('❌ Error: '+error.message);}})();`

2. **Done!** The bookmarklet is now ready to use.

**Every Time You Need Credentials:**

1. Open an **Incognito/Private window** (Ctrl+Shift+N / Cmd+Shift+N)
2. Enable **third-party cookies** in browser settings
3. Go to [home.nest.com](https://home.nest.com) and **sign in**
4. Wait for the page to fully load
5. **Click the bookmarklet** in your bookmarks bar
6. **Automatic!** → Credentials are extracted and copied to clipboard
7. Paste the values below (Issue Token in field 1, Cookies in field 2)

---

### Option 2: Console Script (If bookmarklet doesn't work)

1. Open [home.nest.com](https://home.nest.com) in an **Incognito window** and sign in
2. Press `F12` → Click **Console** tab
3. Paste and run this script:

```javascript
(async function() {
  try {
    if (!window.location.hostname.includes('nest.com')) {
      alert('❌ Wrong website! This script must be run on home.nest.com');
      return;
    }
    const entries = performance.getEntriesByType('resource');
    const issueTokenEntry = entries.find(e => e.name.includes('issueToken'));
    if (!issueTokenEntry) {
      alert('❌ No issueToken found. Please:\n1. Refresh the page (F5)\n2. Wait for it to fully load\n3. Run this script again');
      return;
    }
    const issueToken = issueTokenEntry.name;
    const cookies = document.cookie;
    if (!issueToken.startsWith('https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/iframerpc')) {
      alert('❌ Invalid issue token URL');
      return;
    }
    if (!issueToken.includes('action=issueToken')) {
      alert('❌ Invalid issue token URL (missing action=issueToken)');
      return;
    }
    if (!cookies || cookies.length < 100) {
      alert('❌ Cookies not found or incomplete. Make sure you are signed in.');
      return;
    }
    const requiredCookies = ['HSID=', 'SSID=', 'APISID=', 'SAPISID='];
    const missingCookies = requiredCookies.filter(c => !cookies.includes(c));
    if (missingCookies.length > 0) {
      alert('⚠️ Warning: Missing cookies: ' + missingCookies.join(', ').replace(/=/g, ''));
    }
    console.log('\n========================================');
    console.log('✅ CREDENTIALS EXTRACTED SUCCESSFULLY!');
    console.log('========================================\n');
    console.log('Issue Token URL:\n' + issueToken + '\n');
    console.log('Cookies:\n' + cookies + '\n');
    console.log('========================================\n');
    const text = `Issue Token URL:\n${issueToken}\n\nCookies:\n${cookies}`;
    try {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
      alert('✅ Credentials copied to clipboard!\n\nPaste them into Home Assistant below.');
    } catch (e) {
      alert('✅ Credentials extracted!\n\nCopy them from the console output above.');
    }
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('Error:', error);
    alert('❌ An error occurred: ' + error.message);
  }
})();
```

4. Copy the credentials and paste them below

